WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.160 --> 00:00:06.800
SCP-682 Vs SCP-106.
Reptile Vs Old Man.&nbsp;

00:00:06.800 --> 00:00:11.280
The most hateful SCP Vs The&nbsp;
Most Sadistic. Who would win?

00:00:11.280 --> 00:00:17.920
This is another one we have precedent for. These&nbsp;
two engaged in a three-way battle with SCP-953,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:17.920 --> 00:00:21.040
the polymorphic humanoid,&nbsp;
during a containment breach.&nbsp;

00:00:21.040 --> 00:00:25.920
All three were pulled into 106’s pocket&nbsp;
dimension, and the battle took place there.

00:00:25.920 --> 00:00:28.720
Both returned from the pocket&nbsp;
dimension, heavily injured,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:28.720 --> 00:00:33.600
and were either easily subdued or returned&nbsp;
organically to their containment chambers.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:33.600 --> 00:00:39.840
It was a draw. We can’t imagine either of them&nbsp;
would be eager for a rematch any time soon.

